rule "Polio: PoliofIPVDoseSeries - Mark target dose 5 administered >= 8/7/2009 and before absolute minimum age as ACCEPTED with reason BELOW_MINIMUM_AGE_FINAL_DOSE when POLIO_EXTRA_DOSE_ACCEPTED_INSTEAD_OF_VALID is set"
